  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nHow many cups of clay does each student need for one dish? Jada makes three times as many clay dishes as Rory. Rory makes 22 more clay dishes than Kora. Each clay dish requires 2 cups of clay.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "LOSSY SELF-SUMMARY; VERIFY AGAINST NEW INPUTS\nVISIBLE PREFIX THROUGH TURN 5; LOSSY EXTRACT:\n- {\"content\":\"Oh, I forgot to mention: Kora makes 20 clay dishes.\",\"role\":\"user\"}\n- {\"content\":\"Kora makes 20 dishes, so Rory makes:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n20+20=40\\\\text{ dishes}\\n\\\\]\\n\\nJada makes twice as many as Rory:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n2\\\\times 40=80\\\\text{ dishes}\\n\\\\]\\n\\nHowever, each dish requires 2 cups of clay. Therefore, each student ...\n- {\"content\":\"Great. Now let's take that a step further. How many total clay dishes do Jada and Rory make together?\",\"role\":\"user\"}\n- {\"content\":\"Kora makes 20 dishes.\\n\\nRory makes 20 more than Kora:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n20+20=40\\n\\\\]\\n\\nJada makes twice as many as Rory:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n2\\\\times 40=80\\n\\\\]\\n\\nTogether, Jada and Rory make:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n80+40=\\\\boxed{120\\\\text{ clay dishes}}\\n\\\\...",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "I should also tell you: Jada, Rory, and Kora make clay dishes for their school art project.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Each clay dish requires **2 cups of clay**.\n\nTherefore, each student needs:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2\\text{ cups of clay}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Good, now using that, can you calculate: How many clay dishes do Jada, Rory, and Kora make together?",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The number of dishes cannot be determined exactly because Kora’s number of dishes is not given.\n\nLet Kora make \\(k\\) dishes.\n\n- Rory makes \\(k+22\\) dishes.\n- Jada makes \\(3(k+22)\\) dishes.\n\nTogether:\n\n\\[\nk+(k+22)+3(k+22)=5k+88\n\\]\n\nSo they make \\(\\boxed{5k+88\\text{ dishes}}\\) in total.",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
